      "writtenOn": "2022-12-22T02:34:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A constant is needed to pass to the constructor of ServiceSpecificException (it needs a code), so we do need something. If you remove it and use AStatus_fromExceptionCodeWithMessage with one of the EX_* values, it could also work, but there isn\u0027t an \"UNKNOWN\" value here - all the errors are more specific.",
